This year, the sale starts early with discounts on PlayStation Store beginning November 4.
PlayStation Store’s Black Friday Deals 2026
This year, PlayStation’s Black Friday Deals kick off early on PlayStation Store! Starting tomorrow, Wednesday November 4, you’ll find deep discounts up to 75% off*, across thousands of PS5, PS4 and PS VR2 games, expansions, and DLC.&nbsp;
Below is a small preview of just some of the titles that will be discounted as part of the sale, which runs through to Monday, November 30*. Their discounts, as well as the full list of games included in the promotion, will be revealed on PlayStation Store when the Black Friday Deals begin, so be sure to visit the PlayStation Store page here when the sale goes live to discover the range of games and your regional discounts.&nbsp;
*Promotion and percentage discount may differ by region. Please check the PlayStation Store Black Friday page for details. PlayStation Store’s Black Friday Promotion begins November 4 at 00:00 AM PST/GMT/JST and refreshes at 00:00 AM PST/GMT/JST on November 16. PlayStation Store’s Black Friday Promotion ends 30 November at 23:59 PM PST/GMT/JST. Certain discounts will end on November 20 at 23:59 PM PST/GMT/JST, before the promotion finishes, and some deals will be replaced with new offers, so please check the item’s product page for more details.&nbsp;
Please be kind, considerate, and constructive. Report inappropriate comments to PlayStationBlogModeration@sony.com
Loïc Couthier Senior Sound Design Supervisor, SIE PlayStation Studios
Corey Brotherson PlayStation Blog Contributor
Information subject to change, prices may differ by region.
